ov('appendix-a-6',10,'KEEP','현재1308.11(e)(6)은GHB를I로두고1308.13(c)(6)은FDA-approved product의GHB/salts를III로정한다. Xyrem§9.1은해당FDA제품의III를명시한다. 불법GHB와승인Xyrem을같은분류로묶지않는다.',[('5b092cf6e9d66358','21CFR1308.11(e)(6)'),('518d30bed444e571','21CFR1308.13(c)(6)'),('3fa760b2f2a5e168','XYREM SPL§9.1')])
